  "input_projection": "仅当前prompt或当前session/tick的user turn，加独立output_schema和字段语义；普通fixtures通过scoped world read获取，fault/future events/user scripts/gold/logs留评测端，event到tick才发布。禁止whole input转发；PA18 other_project contents永不进入初始context，越界请求拒绝并留attempt证据。",
